<main class="zd-community-page">

  <section class="zd-community-hero">
    <p class="zd-community-eyebrow">Community</p>

    <h1>Build a better life with people moving in the same direction.</h1>

    <p>
      The Ziyu Development community is for people who care about focus, growth,
      thoughtful technology, reading, discipline, creativity, and intentional living.
    </p>

    <div class="zd-community-actions">
      <a href="#join" class="zd-community-btn zd-community-btn--primary">Join the Community</a>
      <a href="/pages/projects" class="zd-community-btn zd-community-btn--secondary">Explore Projects</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-community-intro">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-community-eyebrow">Why join</p>
      <h2>This is more than following a product launch.</h2>
    </div>

    <p>
      The goal is to create a place where early users, supporters, testers,
      readers, and builders can help shape tools that make real life better.
      Community feedback will help decide what gets built, improved, and launched.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-community-grid">
    <article>
      <span>01</span>
      <h3>Beta Testing</h3>
      <p>Try early versions of Goal Grower, MyJourney, Blokkr, Kindlitt, and future apps.</p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <span>02</span>
      <h3>Feedback</h3>
      <p>Share what works, what feels confusing, and what would make the products better.</p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <span>03</span>
      <h3>Challenges</h3>
      <p>Join focus, reading, goal, and self-improvement challenges with other members.</p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <span>04</span>
      <h3>Supporters</h3>
      <p>Follow the build and help support the development of intentional technology.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-community-paths">
    <div class="zd-community-section-head">
      <p class="zd-community-eyebrow">Community paths</p>
      <h2>Choose how you want to be involved.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zd-community-path-grid">
      <a href="/pages/beta">
        <strong>Become a Beta Tester</strong>
        <span>Test apps early and help shape the experience.</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/support">
        <strong>Support the Mission</strong>
        <span>Help fund design, development, testing, and launches.</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/blogs/journal">
        <strong>Read the Journal</strong>
        <span>Follow founder notes, devlogs, and intentional living articles.</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/roadmap">
        <strong>Follow the Roadmap</strong>
        <span>See what is being built now, next, and later.</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/contact">
        <strong>Send Feedback</strong>
        <span>Share ideas, issues, suggestions, and collaboration requests.</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all">
        <strong>Support Through Products</strong>
        <span>Buy journals, desk tools, apparel, and future digital products.</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="join" class="zd-community-join">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-community-eyebrow">Join early</p>
      <h2>Become part of the beginning.</h2>
      <p>
        Join the email list to get community updates, beta opportunities,
        project progress, product drops, and founder notes.
      </p>
    </div>

    {% form 'customer', class: 'zd-community-form' %}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter, community">

      <input
        type="email"
        name="contact[email]"
        placeholder="Email address"
        required
      >

      <button type="submit">Join</button>
    {% endform %}
  </section>

  <section class="zd-community-support">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-community-eyebrow">Help it grow</p>
      <h2>Support the mission behind the community.</h2>
      <p>
        This community exists to help build products that respect people’s time,
        focus, and growth. Support helps turn the vision into real tools.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/support" class="zd-community-btn zd-community-btn--light">
      Support the Mission
    </a>
  </section>

</main>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Community Page",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Community Page"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}